  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Stance. For 1...4...5 second[s], you have a 75% chance to block melee and projectile attacks. When Defensive Stance ends, you gain one strike of adrenaline for each melee attack skill you have (maximum 0...3...4).",
      "zhTW": "持續 1～5 秒，你有 75% 機率格檔攻擊，此態勢終止時，依照你擁有的近身攻擊技能數量，每個使你獲得 1 次攻擊的怒氣值。 (最多 0～4)"
    },
